msgid ""
"The bottom of this lamp contains the words 'Property of the Atmospheric Sciences Department'.\n"
"\n"
"It's worth noting that the Gravitas Atmospheric Sciences Department once simulated an experiment testing the feasibility of survival in an environment filled with noble gases, similar to the ones contained within this device."
msgstr ""

